  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save a Poor Divorcee from Breast Cancer in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support Mrs Helen to undertake all the necessary treatment that is required to manage breast cancer. Mrs Helen is a 54-year-old poor divorcee and a mother of three, who has been feeding from hand to mouth and finds it very hard to take care of herself and her children. She was diagnosed with breast cancer last month and has been at the emergency unit of Nnamdi Azikiwe University Teaching Hospital Nnewi-Anambra State, receiving treatment. Your donations will help to save her.</narrative>
  </description>
